   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEEPA,Capacity Building Project,2009-2012 - CEEPA,Capacity Building Projec</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CEEPA,Capacity Building Project,2009-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r &#xf6;ka den akademiska och professionella niv&#xe5;n hos deltagarna. Programmet bidrar &#xe4;ven till att sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndig samh&#xe4;llsvetenskaplig forskning p&#xe5; milj&#xf6;omr&#xe5;det kan genomf&#xf6;ras i &#xf6;stra och s&#xf6;dra Afrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to raise the academic and  professional profile of the participants. Research funding is at that core of the programme and will contribute to independent social research into areas of environmental concern in eastern and southern Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
